discover: Digoxin levels—

35
00:02:36,829 --> 00:02:38,573
a potent cardiac medication—

36
00:02:38,573 --> 00:02:41,188
in the priest’s bloodstream were dozens of

37
00:02:41,188 --> 00:02:43,928
times higher than the
therapeutic threshold.

38
00:02:44,878 --> 00:02:46,956
This was no medical mistake.

39
00:02:47,606 --> 00:02:52,218
It was a lethal overdose dozens
of times above allowable limits,

40
00:02:52,218 --> 00:02:56,685
