45
00:03:13,362 --> 00:03:16,416
Somerset Medical Center was not the first.

46
00:03:16,766 --> 00:03:19,470
Across sixteen years, from 1988 to 2003,

47
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:23,324
Charles Cullen had moved
through nine different hospitals

48
00:03:23,324 --> 00:03:27,110
