New Jersey and Pennsylvania.

49
00:03:27,860 --> 00:03:29,224
And wherever he went,

50
00:03:29,224 --> 00:03:32,732
the rate of patients suffering
fatal nocturnal cardiac

51
00:03:32,732 --> 00:03:35,720
arrests spiked in a
bizarre statistical curve.

52
00:03:36,670 --> 00:03:40,490
