53
00:03:41,140 --> 00:03:45,919
Yet based on medication dispensing logs
and sixteen years of medical charts,

54
00:03:45,919 --> 00:03:48,875
our team and forensic
epidemiologists estimate:

55
00:03:48,875 --> 00:03:53,654
The true victim count could range from
three hundred to four hundred people,

56
00:03:53,654 --> 00:03:56,547
making Charles Cullen
the most prolific serial

57
00:03:56,547 --> 00:04:00,131
perpetrator in the entire
history of American healthcare.

58
00:04:01,831 --> 00:04:04,653
[HOST] Welcome to the criminal
psychology case files.

59
00:04:05,003 --> 00:04:05,407
Today,

60
00:04:05,407 --> 00:04:10,928
