78
00:05:17,999 --> 00:05:23,200
Let us invite the Investigator to reconstruct
this sophisticated modus operandi.

79
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:25,416
[INVESTIGATOR] In the early 2000s,

80
00:05:25,416 --> 00:05:28,679
American hospitals began
transitioning to automated

81
00:05:28,679 --> 00:05:32,327
