for every transaction.

87
00:05:49,469 --> 00:05:54,438
However, Charles Cullen uncovered a
fatal loophole in the operating software:

88
00:05:55,088 --> 00:05:59,710
First, he would log into the system and
look up the name of any arbitrary patient,

89
00:05:59,710 --> 00:06:02,078
