drawer latch unlocked,

94
00:06:15,168 --> 00:06:18,277
Cullen immediately hit the
“Cancel” button on the touchscreen.

95
00:06:18,627 --> 00:06:21,927
He swiftly reached his hand
in and snatched the medication

96
00:06:21,927 --> 00:06:24,885
