100
00:06:36,304 --> 00:06:40,311
Afterwards, in the dead of night
when no eyes were watching,

101
00:06:40,311 --> 00:06:44,117
Cullen used a syringe to inject
lethal overdoses directly

102
00:06:44,117 --> 00:06:47,589
