352
00:23:19,650 --> 00:23:24,295
[PSYCHOLOGIST] The first red
flag: The False “Savior” Syndrome.

353
00:23:24,945 --> 00:23:27,867
Exercise vigilance regarding
individuals who crave

354
00:23:27,867 --> 00:23:30,671
